.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm emacs-journal-2026-04-16
.Nd working notes of 2026-04-16
.Sh ENTRIES
.Ss Fix nix flake check
.Ss Summary
Made
.Ql "nix flake check"
pass.
Fixed two categories of issues:
.Ss 1. Nixfmt formatting (nix/use-package.nix)
Reformatted the
.Ql "if/else"
expression in
.Ql "toEmacsPackage"
to match nixfmt's expected style (indented
.Ql "else"
branch with parenthesised body).
.Ss 2. Elisp byte-compile errors (checks.x86_64-linux.elisp-compile)
The check runs
.Ql "batch-byte-compile"
with
.Ql "byte-compile-error-on-warn t" ,
turning all byte-compile warnings into hard errors.
.Pp
\fBFree variables in
.Ql "early-init.el" Ns No "\fP"
— Added
.Ql "defvar"
declarations for variables that are only set inside conditional guards but not defined in the current compilation context:
.Ql "package-quickstart" ,
.Ql "warning-suppress-log-types" ,
.Ql "use-package-enable-imenu-support" ,
.Ql "use-package-always-ensure" ,
.Ql "ns-use-thin-smoothing"
(macOS-only),
.Ql "native-comp-async-report-warnings-errors" ,
.Ql "native-comp-speed" ,
and
.Ql "treesit-extra-load-path" .
.Pp
\fBSandbox
.Ql "make-directory"
failure\fP —
.Ql "init-core.el"
called
.Ql "(make-directory jotain-var-dir t)"
at top level, which runs during batch compilation in the Nix sandbox where
.Ql "~/.emacs.d/"
can't be created.
Wrapped in
.Ql "ignore-errors" .
.Pp
.No "\fB" Ns Ql "rxt--re-builder-switch-pcre-mode"
from pcre2el\fP —
.Ql "magit-todos"
loads
.Ql "pcre2el" ,
which has a
.Ql "defadvice ... compile"
that byte-compiles its advice body at activation time.
With
.Ql "byte-compile-error-on-warn t"
active, the forward reference to
.Ql "rxt--re-builder-switch-pcre-mode"
in that advice body fails.
Fixed by adding
.Ql "(require 'pcre2el)"
to
.Ql "nix/checks.nix"
before setting the flag, so pcre2el's advice compiles without the flag active.
.Pp
\fBFunctions not known to the byte-compiler\fP — Added
.Ql ":functions (...)"
to
.Ql "use-package"
blocks in
.Ql "init-ai" ,
.Ql "init-completion" ,
.Ql "init-core" ,
.Ql "init-editing" ,
.Ql "init-navigation" ,
.Ql "init-org" ,
.Ql "init-prog" ,
.Ql "init-project" ,
.Ql "init-systems" ,
.Ql "init-tracking" ,
.Ql "init-ui" ,
.Ql "init-vc" .
Also added a
.Ql "declare-function"
for
.Ql "jotain-core--auto-create-missing-dirs"
(defined inside a
.Ql ":config"
block).
.Pp
.No "\fB" Ns Ql "diff-hl-magit-pre-refresh"
obsolete\fP — Replaced with
.Ql "ignore"
as the diff-hl 1.11.0 changelog requires.
.Pp
.No "\fB" Ns Ql "treesit-fold-indicators-priority"
free variable\fP — Changed
.Ql ":init (setq ...) "
to
.Ql ":custom (...)"
so the variable is set via
.Ql "customize-set-variable"
after the package loads (when the variable is bound).
